wing. If possible I would like to suggest: \n1) Drawing \n2) Drinking cream soda\n3) Napping\n4) Singing\n5) Crying on the floor\n\nThank you for all your hard work! IF possible, I would like to use these chibis for my streams on Twitch, Youtube and other social media. I would also like to have these chibis with a transparent background so I can use them separately. Thank you!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@ithuki26/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1319597, "client_id": 1416113, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4c59c582/uploads/origins/d9b4c547-f1cc-4a84-800c-cfd10e53689e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6aef74730eccf35748acc48a6d2a886f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4c59c582/uploads/origins/d9b4c547-f1cc-4a84-800c-cfd10e53689e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6aef74730eccf35748acc48a6d2a886f, https://si.imgix.net/4c59c582/uploads/origins/d9b4c547-f1cc-4a84-800c-cfd10e53689e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa40bd19387bb37a41a210f58630ff27 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4c59c582/uploads/origins/d9b4c547-f1cc-4a84-800c-cfd10e53689e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1f6999a527198b1213355d341ec11e7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4c59c582/uploads/origins/d9b4c547-f1cc-4a84-800c-cfd10e53689e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3b5d47915e81d1fd3538c629c7725af3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4c59c582/uploads/origins/d9b4c547-f1cc-4a84-800c-cfd10e53689e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3b5d47915e81d1fd3538c629c7725af3, https://si.imgix.n